{"seq":3,"slug":"configurator-state-share-cross-device","title":"配置器前端状态、可分享链接与跨端一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/visual-configurator-preview-artwork/configurator-state-share-cross-device","wordCount":3012,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"配置器前端状态-可分享链接与跨端一致性\">配置器前端状态、可分享链接与跨端一致性</h1><p>买家在手机上配好一件印着 LOGO 的卫衣，把链接发到桌面浏览器继续微调，再回到手机下单——如果两次打开的&quot;同一件衣服&quot;在某个选项上差了值，泄漏进订单的就是一次未经确认的定制承诺。本文讨论配置器里最容易被低估的一层：<strong>配置状态本身</strong>如何被规范化、编码进可分享链接、在设备间保持一致，以及规则版本变化时如何不把旧链接变成脏数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>配置器的一次定制是一份<strong>结构化文档</strong>而非松散表单值：用户选了什么（唯一权威的<strong>配置状态</strong> configuration state）与渲染、报价、工单（都由它派生的投影 projection）必须分开。把状态形式化为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>sku</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mtext>opts</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>place</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>art</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>profile</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>locale</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>rule</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\langle V_{\\text{sku}}, O_{\\text{opts}}, P_{\\text{place}}, A_{\\text{art}}, C_{\\text{profile}}, L_{\\text{locale}}, R_{\\text{rule}} \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sku</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">opts</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">place</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">art</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">profile</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">locale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rule</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>sku</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{sku}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sku</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基础 SKU，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mtext>opts</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_{\\text{opts}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">opts</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是选项选择集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>place</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{place}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">place</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是画布上的放置（位置、缩放、旋转），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>art</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{art}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">art</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是设计稿引用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>profile</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{profile}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">profile</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是色彩/材质等输出规格，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>locale</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{locale}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">locale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定币种与合规提示，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>rule</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{rule}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rule</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>当时生效的约束规则集版本</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[配置状态 S 唯一事实源] --&gt; U[URL 分享链接&lt;br/&gt;编码 / 校验 / 迁移]&#10;  S --&gt; D[持久化草稿&lt;br/&gt;本地或服务端]&#10;  S --&gt; R[渲染投影&lt;br/&gt;预览 / 3D]&#10;  S --&gt; Q[报价投影]&#10;  S --&gt; M[制造投影&lt;br/&gt;工单 recipe]&#10;  U --&gt; H[hydrate 到新设备 store]&#10;  D --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; S\">graph TD\n  S[配置状态 S 唯一事实源] --&gt; U[URL 分享链接&lt;br/&gt;编码 / 校验 / 迁移]\n  S --&gt; D[持久化草稿&lt;br/&gt;本地或服务端]\n  S --&gt; R[渲染投影&lt;br/&gt;预览 / 3D]\n  S --&gt; Q[报价投影]\n  S --&gt; M[制造投影&lt;br/&gt;工单 recipe]\n  U --&gt; H[hydrate 到新设备 store]\n  D --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; S</pre><p>最后一项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>rule</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{rule}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rule</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是跨境定制特有、也最常被忽略的字段。约束规则（某材质不支持某工艺、某地区不可售）会随合规与产能变化而更新；一条三个月前的分享链接若只带选项值、不带规则版本，在新规则下 hydrate 时就会出现&quot;选项组合已非法&quot;的悬空状态。<strong>把规则版本视为配置状态的一部分</strong>，是让链接可长期复用的前提（规则版本化本身属于约束规则章节，见本 hub 的 <a href=\"../constraint-rules-cpq-guided-selling/constraint-rule-engine-architecture\">约束规则引擎架构</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态模型-规范化与最小表示\">状态模型：规范化与最小表示</h2><p>同一个配置可以由无数种字节序列表示：选项排列顺序、未选择项的默认值、字符串的 Unicode 组合形式、数字的浮点表示。若表示不唯一，&quot;两条链接是否指向同一配置&quot;就无法用字节比较回答，缓存、去重、审计、签名随之失效。解法是定义一个<strong>规范化形式</strong>（canonical form）——整个系统里唯一被持久化、被签名、被比较的表示。它要处理四件事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>顺序无关</strong>：选项集合按稳定键（option id 的字典序）排序，而不是按用户点击顺序——否则同一配置产生不同字节。</li>\n<li><strong>默认值省略</strong>：与 SKU 默认值相等的字段不写入表示，显著缩小链接长度——某 SKU 若有 12 个选项、平均只改动 4 个，省略默认值通常能把载荷压到原来的三分之一。</li>\n<li><strong>Unicode 归一化</strong>：用户输入的文字（刻字、姓名）先做 NFC 归一化（Unicode 标准附件 UAX #15），否则一个由基础字母加组合符组成的 &quot;é&quot; 与预组合字符 &quot;é&quot; 会是两个不同字节、两条不同链接。</li>\n<li><strong>数值与时间确定化</strong>：浮点放置坐标统一为定点整数（如毫米 × 100），时间戳用 RFC 3339 格式，避免 <code>0.1+0.2</code> 类表示差异。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>要把规范化后的状态用于签名、去重或缓存键，还必须选定一个<strong>确定性 JSON 序列化</strong>。这正是 IETF 的 <strong>RFC 8785（JSON Canonicalization Scheme, JCS, 2020）</strong> 所定义的：对同样的数据结构，任何合规实现都产出<strong>逐字节相同</strong>的输出，从而可以直接对 JSON 求哈希或签名。状态指纹因此可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>SHA-256</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>canonical</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = \\text{SHA-256}\\big(\\mathrm{JCS}(S_{\\text{canonical}})\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SHA-256</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">JCS</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">canonical</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 可用于三处：去重（同一配置不重复建草稿）、缓存（渲染结果按状态指纹入缓存）、幂等下单（重试提交同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 不会产生两笔订单，对应下单接口的幂等键）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可分享链接-编码通道与长度预算\">可分享链接：编码通道与长度预算</h2><p>&quot;分享&quot;在实现上有三条通道，选择取决于要传输的字段、长度预算与安全要求。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>典型形态</th>\n<th>长度特征</th>\n<th>适用与风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>扁平查询参数</td>\n<td><code>?sku=x&amp;size=L&amp;mat=cotton</code></td>\n<td>可读、SEO 友好；字段一多冗长且易暴露内部 id</td>\n<td>选项少、需被爬虫索引的产品页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打包载荷</td>\n<td>JSON → 压缩 → Base64url 单参数</td>\n<td>短、紧凑；不可读，需版本前缀</td>\n<td>含放置坐标/设计稿引用的复杂定制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签名令牌</td>\n<td>JWS/JWT 单参数</td>\n<td>最长（含签名段）；不可篡改、可设过期</td>\n<td>需防篡改的报价锁定、B2B 报价单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>打包载荷那条通道的技术细节值得展开。序列化后的字节先做压缩（<code>deflate</code>，RFC 1951；或 <code>Brotli</code>，RFC 7932），再做 <strong>Base64url</strong> 编码（RFC 4648 §5，用 <code>-</code>/<code>_</code> 替换 <code>+</code>/<code>/</code> 并去掉填充），因为标准 Base64 的 <code>+</code>/<code>/</code>/<code>=</code> 在 URL 里必须转义、会白白膨胀长度。编码后长度近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>sig</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\approx L_{\\text{base}} + \\left\\lceil \\frac{8n}{6} \\right\\rceil + L_{\\text{sig}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sig</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是压缩后字节数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>sig</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{sig}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sig</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仅在签名通道里非零。这条公式决定了<strong>长度硬预算</strong>：浏览器能处理很长的 URL，但<strong>服务器与代理普遍对请求行长度设上限</strong>（常见约 8KB），邮件客户端、IM 富文本、二维码等消费端更会提前截断。因此实践规则是<strong>分享链接控制在 2000 字符以内</strong>，这是社交与邮件生态能安全往返的范围；超预算时不要把状态硬塞进 URL，而应把它落到服务端、链接里只带一个短 id。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[打开分享链接] --&gt; B{含载荷还是短 id?}&#10;  B --&gt;|载荷| C[Base64url 解码 + 解压]&#10;  B --&gt;|短 id| D[服务端取回状态]&#10;  C --&gt; E{签名有效且未过期?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[拒绝并给出重新配置入口]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G[schema 版本迁移]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{选项在当前规则下仍合法?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[标记冲突项 + 引导修正]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J[hydrate 到 store 完成渲染]\">graph TD\n  A[打开分享链接] --&gt; B{含载荷还是短 id?}\n  B --&gt;|载荷| C[Base64url 解码 + 解压]\n  B --&gt;|短 id| D[服务端取回状态]\n  C --&gt; E{签名有效且未过期?}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[拒绝并给出重新配置入口]\n  E --&gt;|是| G[schema 版本迁移]\n  D --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{选项在当前规则下仍合法?}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[标记冲突项 + 引导修正]\n  H --&gt;|是| J[hydrate 到 store 完成渲染]</pre><p>配置器的这一层还藏着一个常被忽视的隐私面。分享链接把状态编码进 URL，而 URL 会进入浏览器历史、被分享到聊天工具、被站点日志与第三方分析上报。<strong>如果状态含用户输入的个人信息（刻字姓名、手机号、收货备注），放进查询字符串就等于把 PII 写进所有会记录 URL 的地方。</strong> 正确做法是：分享载荷只携带<strong>非敏感的配置维度</strong>，任何 PII 走登录态下的服务端草稿、以短 id 引用；这也是 GDPR 第 5(1)(c) 条数据最小化原则对 URL 设计的具体约束。签名令牌通道（<strong>RFC 7515 JWS</strong> / <strong>RFC 7519 JWT</strong>）用于锁定报价等防篡改场景，但签名只提供完整性、不提供机密性，其载荷同样不得含 PII。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨端一致性与草稿生命周期\">跨端一致性与草稿生命周期</h2><p>&quot;在手机上配、在桌面上继续&quot;要求状态跨设备迁移，而设备之间没有共享内存，只能靠<strong>服务端草稿</strong>或<strong>短 id 映射</strong>。第一条工程事实是：<strong>不要把服务的可用性押在客户端存储上</strong>。</p>\n<p>WebKit 的 Intelligent Tracking Prevention（ITP）自 2019 年起对<strong>脚本可写存储</strong>（<code>localStorage</code>、IndexedDB 等）施加清理策略：站点超过 7 天无用户交互，其脚本可写存储会被清除。这意味着匿名用户的本地草稿<strong>最多只有约 7 天的可靠窗口</strong>，清理站点数据、换浏览器、用无痕模式都会立即丢失。因此存储面必须分层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储面</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存 store</td>\n<td>当前标签页会话</td>\n<td>交互中的实时状态，最快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>URL 分享链接</td>\n<td>只要链接存在</td>\n<td>可显式分享、跨设备传递的快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>localStorage</code> / IndexedDB</td>\n<td>受 ITP 约束，约 7 天</td>\n<td>匿名用户的续配提示与本地草稿缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端草稿</td>\n<td>由账号与保留策略决定</td>\n<td><strong>跨设备一致的权威副本</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨设备的<strong>权威副本必须是服务端草稿</strong>，本地存储只当缓存。匿名用户先在本地存、登录后做一次<strong>合并（merge）</strong>：以服务端草稿为基线，用状态指纹 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 判断是否分叉，无分叉直接采用；有分叉时选项集合可按字段级&quot;最后写入优先&quot;合并，而<strong>放置坐标与设计稿引用这类不可自动合并的字段必须让用户显式选择保留哪一份</strong>——自动猜测会静默丢弃用户的设计工作。若草稿需要稳定且可按时间排序的标识，<strong>RFC 9562（UUID v7，2024）</strong> 的时间有序 UUID 是合适选择：既全局唯一又保留创建时序，利于分页与清理。</p>\n<p>跨端一致性的另一半是<strong>规则版本对齐</strong>。链接或草稿里记着 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>rule</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{rule}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rule</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当它落后于当前生效版本时，hydrate 流程必须走一次<strong>显式迁移</strong>：逐项校验选项在当前规则下是否仍合法（可用性、地区禁售、工艺相容），把冲突项标红并引导用户修正，而不是静默替换成默认值——静默替换会让用户在下单前一刻才发现&quot;我选的材质没了&quot;。迁移函数应是纯粹的、可测试的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{old}} \\to S_{\\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 映射，对无法自动迁移的组合返回结构化冲突列表。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>关于状态如何驱动渲染与印前投影片道，见同章节的 <a href=\"3d-webgl-configurator-rendering\">3D 与 WebGL 配置器渲染</a> 与 <a href=\"realtime-preview-artwork-upload-pipeline\">实时预览与设计稿上传管线</a>：本文负责&quot;状态是什么、怎么传、怎么对齐版本&quot;，那两篇负责&quot;状态被渲染成什么&quot;。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"一致性陷阱与验证清单\">一致性陷阱与验证清单</h2><p>配置状态这一层的缺陷往往不报错、不崩溃，只<strong>静默地给出错误结果</strong>，必须靠针对性验证而非端到端点击来捕获。以下是常见陷阱与验证动作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>验证动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选项未排序即序列化</td>\n<td>同一配置两条链接、缓存失效</td>\n<td>打乱输入顺序，断言状态指纹 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未做 NFC 归一化</td>\n<td>刻字内容不同的两个&quot;相同&quot;配置</td>\n<td>用组合字符与预组合字符各生成一次，断言 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 相等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮点坐标直接入链接</td>\n<td>跨平台浮点差异、长度膨胀</td>\n<td>断言坐标以定点整数表示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分享载荷含 PII</td>\n<td>URL 泄漏个人信息到日志与分析</td>\n<td>对生成链接做模式扫描，PII 字段必须为空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链接无过期/无签名</td>\n<td>报价被篡改、长期悬空</td>\n<td>断言过期后拒绝、篡改一字节后签名校验失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迁移静默替换选项</td>\n<td>用户下单前发现配置被改</td>\n<td>断言非法组合返回冲突列表而非默认值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖 localStorage 存关键草稿</td>\n<td>约 7 天后草稿消失</td>\n<td>模拟存储被清空，断言仍能从服务端恢复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个端到端验证把多项串起来：<strong>生成链接 → 新 store hydrate → 断言 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 一致 → 篡改一字节 → 断言被拒绝 → 回退规则版本 → 断言冲突项被标记而非替换</strong>。它不依赖 UI，可在 CI 对真值快照运行，是&quot;链接永远指回同一件商品&quot;的最小回归集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>配置器前端的这一层没有炫目的视觉，却决定定制承诺是否可靠。其一，<strong>状态是唯一事实源</strong>，渲染、报价、工单都是它的投影；规范化（顺序无关、省略默认值、NFC 归一化、数值确定化）加 RFC 8785 确定性序列化，让同一配置有唯一字节表示与状态指纹 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>。其二，<strong>可分享链接是编码通道而非数据容器</strong>，按字段与安全需求在扁平参数、Base64url 打包载荷、JWS/JWT 签名令牌之间选择，守住 2000 字符上限与 URL 不含 PII 的底线。其三，<strong>跨端一致性靠服务端草稿而非本地存储</strong>，在 WebKit ITP 约 7 天清理窗口之外建立权威副本，对落后的规则版本走显式迁移、把冲突交回用户而非静默替换。把这三条落成可测试的不变量，跨端配置就从偶发 bug 变成工程上可控的一层。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"配置器前端状态、可分享链接与跨端一致性","id":"配置器前端状态-可分享链接与跨端一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"状态模型：规范化与最小表示","id":"状态模型-规范化与最小表示"},{"level":2,"text":"可分享链接：编码通道与长度预算","id":"可分享链接-编码通道与长度预算"},{"level":2,"text":"跨端一致性与草稿生命周期","id":"跨端一致性与草稿生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性陷阱与验证清单","id":"一致性陷阱与验证清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实时预览与设计稿上传管线：拼版合图、打样与印前文件生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/visual-configurator-preview-artwork/realtime-preview-artwork-upload-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"动态定价引擎：基础价、选项加价与阶梯/成本加成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/dynamic-pricing-pod-fulfillment-ops/dynamic-pricing-rule-quantity-ladder"}}